Package: TSCure
Title: Semiparametric Transformation Mixture Cure Models for Case-Cohort Studies
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(person('Xu', 'Cao', role = c('aut', 'cre'), email = 'xuc@ucr.edu'), person('Qingning', 'Zhou', role = 'aut'))
Description: Implements inverse probability weighted estimation and
    efficiency-improved estimation for semiparametric transformation
    mixture cure models under generalized case-cohort sampling.
    Provides simulation tools, weighted bootstrap inference, and
    model selection using the Akaike information criterion.
    The methodology is described in "Improving Estimation Efficiency
    for Case-cohort Studies with a Cure Fraction".
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: splines2, stats,  utils
Suggests: survival, testthat (>= 3.0.0), knitr, rmarkdown
Config/testthat/edition: 3
